            <ArticleTitle>Stent fracture and collapse in a saphenous vein graft causing occlusive restenosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>E137-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of occlusion of a saphenous vein graft due to complete stent fracture. This was successfully managed percutaneously, with an excellent angiographic and clinical result.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
